  "title": "短代码使用整理",
  "summary": "<p>整理一下短代码格式、效果和来源。如无特殊注明，参考来自<a data-render=\"link\" data-external=\"true\" href=\"https://www.sleepymoon.cyou/2023/hugo-shortcodes/#%E5%8D%A1%E7%89%87%E6%A0%B7%E5%BC%8F\" target=\"_blank\">Hugo|在Stack主题上可行的短代码们<span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><svg width=\".7em\" height=\".7em\" viewBox=\"0 0 21 21\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m13 3l3.293 3.293l-7 7l1…",
  "content": "<p>整理一下短代码格式、效果和来源。如无特殊注明，参考来自<a href=\"https://www.sleepymoon.cyou/2023/hugo-shortcodes/#%E5%8D%A1%E7%89%87%E6%A0%B7%E5%BC%8F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hugo|在Stack主题上可行的短代码们<span></span></a></p>\n<h1>bilibili</h1>\n<p>播放器嵌入参考了：<a href=\"https://blog.iyu.icu/posts/shortcode_bilibili/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">使用Shortcodes在Hugo博客中优雅的嵌入B站视频<span></span></a></p>\n<p>bilibili视频分享嵌入代码中，可以提取视频的avid。迟早有一天我要改成avid和bvid都能用的shortcodes。</p>\n<p>短代码格式: <code>{{&lt; bilibili 视频ID &gt;}}</code>，支持 avid 和 bvid。</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n<div>\n  <div>\n    \n\n    <div>\n      \n        <img src=\"https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9f131ef184537a429c37dc6f1b6e08ac6ccbe203.jpg\" alt=\"这就是我和掷面虫热血沸腾的组合技口牙\">\n      \n      <div>\n         <div>\n            \n         </div>\n         <div>\n           <div>这就是我和掷面虫热血沸腾的组合技口牙</div>\n           <div><span>UP</span> 小号光头official</div>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<h1>mastodon 嘟文嵌入</h1>\n<p>这个shortcodes只能适用于单一server单一用户。</p>\n<p>短代码格式: <code>&lt; mastodon status=&quot;嘟文数字id&quot; &gt;</code></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>neodb 嵌入</h1>\n<p>短代码格式 <code>&lt;neodb &quot;条目链接&quot;&gt;</code>。</p>\n<p>但是由于<code>i/o timeout</code>无法嵌入，是由于你我都了解的原因，因此neodb原生卡片嵌入暂时放弃。</p>\n<h1>重点标记</h1>\n<p>短代码格式 <code>&lt;mark text=&quot;text&quot;&gt;</code>\n<mark>重点颜色</mark>\n，和选中颜色一样。</p>\n<h1>折叠</h1>\n<div><span>PlainText</span><div><pre><code><span><span>1</span><span>{\\{&lt; details &quot;叠叠乐&quot; &gt;}}\n</span></span><span><span>2</span><span>&lt;p&gt;叠叠p1&lt;/p&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>3</span><span>&lt;p&gt;叠叠p2&lt;/p&gt;\n</span></span><span><span>4</span><span>{\\{&lt; /details &gt;}}</span></span></code></pre></div></div>\n\n    叠叠乐<p>叠叠p1</p>\n<p>叠叠p2</p>",
